  v_stop_entry["Camera::stop returns 0 if <br/>it is not running and <br/>returns the error if the <br/>access check fails."]
  v_blocking_stop["PipelineHandler::stop is <br/>called with Blocking. It is <br/>Direct in the same thread; <br/>otherwise, the caller waits <br/>on that InvokeMessage#39;s <br/>semaphore."]
  v_stop_return["After the call, <br/>Camera::stop asserts that <br/>no requests are pending, <br/>sets the state, and returns <br/>0."]
  v_queued_receiver["A separate Object#39;s Queued <br/>invocation runs <br/>asynchronously and is not <br/>guaranteed to run before <br/>the thread stops."]
  v_pointer_check["The verification plan <br/>checks the separate <br/>receiver#39;s last use of the <br/>Request pointer before <br/>deletion or reuse. This is <br/>not a test result."]
